    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Struggle Weapon Girl is a stage-clearing action game in which you have to knock down a large number of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run up a building in a futuristic city or jump down to the lowest level, every place becomes a battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591470/extras/71a151eb9d23e3d20631ee38f190b7a5.poster.avif?t=1745028461\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591470/extras/71a151eb9d23e3d20631ee38f190b7a5.webm?t=1745028461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591470/extras/71a151eb9d23e3d20631ee38f190b7a5.mp4?t=1745028461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist is a mercenary for hire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the city where he has arrived, he has long held off an invasion by invaders, but the war is going badly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He hires mercenaries and deploys them to fill the overwhelming gap in strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every part of the city is under attack and in danger of falling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you join the war, the story begins to take off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go to the battlefield</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive requests from city operators and wipe out the enemy in the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purchase weapons with collected parts and power up</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect parts found on the stage and bring them to the store to exchange them for weapons.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Struggle Weapon Girl is a stage-clearing action game in which you have to knock down a large number of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run up a building in a futuristic city or jump down to the lowest level, every place becomes a battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591470/extras/71a151eb9d23e3d20631ee38f190b7a5.poster.avif?t=1745028461\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591470/extras/71a151eb9d23e3d20631ee38f190b7a5.webm?t=1745028461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591470/extras/71a151eb9d23e3d20631ee38f190b7a5.mp4?t=1745028461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist is a mercenary for hire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the city where he has arrived, he has long held off an invasion by invaders, but the war is going badly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He hires mercenaries and deploys them to fill the overwhelming gap in strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every part of the city is under attack and in danger of falling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you join the war, the story begins to take off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go to the battlefield</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive requests from city operators and wipe out the enemy in the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purchase weapons with collected parts and power up</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect parts found on the stage and bring them to the store to exchange them for weapons.</p>",
